<title>NORWAY: Orkla 8-month results per division.</title>
<headline>Orkla 8-month results per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating results per division for the eight months to August 31.</p>
<p>				   (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Beverages				 266	 vs	  174</p>
<p>Foods				     351	 vs	  193</p>
<p>Brands				    258	 vs	  219</p>
<p>Media					97	 vs	   82</p>
<p>Eliminations		    minus  30	 vs   minus 21</p>
<p>Total branded consumer goods	942	 vs	  647</p>
<p>Chemicals				 326	 vs	  333</p>
<p>Unallocated/eliminations    minus  46	 vs	    0</p>
<p>Other income/costs		     20	 vs	  114</p>
<p>Total industry			1,242	 vs	1,094</p>
<p>Investments				39	 vs	   11</p>
<p>Total operating result	    1,281	 vs	1,105</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
